ame at a young age  megan and harry also enclosed a special  message of gratitude for their  supporters  writing in the announcement quote on  june 4th we were blessed with the  arrival of our daughter lily  she is more than we could have ever  imagined and we remain grateful for the  love and prayers we felt from across the  globe  thank you for your continued kindness  and support during this very special  time for our family  well absolutely megan is going to take  some maternity leave she didn't have  much maternity leave last time round but  i'm told  second time round she's actually going  to make a point of  taking some time out enjoying this time  and  prince harry's also going to take his  paternity leave too  and this is actually the second time  diana's name has been honored by her two  boys  when princess charlotte was born in 2015  prince william and kate middleton  also included diana in her full name  charlotte elizabeth diana mountbatten  windsor  amid the reported rift between harry and  william following harry and megan  exiting the royal family in 2020  as well as the couple's headline making  interview with oprah winfrey  many have voiced hope that their new  bundle of joy could help men some of  their hurt feelings  well i think there's always the hope  that a new baby  will help to heal any risks they're  obviously a source of  absolute joy and you know william and  kate will be  incredibly excited to be welcoming and a  niece into the family  the first girl for harry and megan and i  think everyone hopes that  by the time this little girl arrives  there will have been more conversations  and they will be in a better place and  of course harry's due to come over in  july  for the unveiling of the diana statue so  i think there are opportunities for  a better relationship between the  [Music]  brothers  you
 

